WEBVTT

00:00:03.171 --> 00:00:05.267
A report can be only data.

00:00:05.267 --> 00:00:12.341
This campaign summary is a plain table, with viewer filters, a calculated completion rate, and totals.

00:00:12.795 --> 00:00:15.501
A report can combine charts and data.

00:00:15.501 --> 00:00:19.466
This one shows a metric strip, a bar chart and a table of

00:00:19.466 --> 00:00:21.605
activity outcomes per agent.

00:00:22.057 --> 00:00:24.341
Tables can show subtotals.

00:00:24.341 --> 00:00:29.766
With Role, Agent and Status, there is a subtotal for each agent within

00:00:29.766 --> 00:00:33.407
a role, one for each role, and a grand total.

00:00:33.858 --> 00:00:38.727
Pie charts and pivot tables suit shares and cross-tabs, such as the share

00:00:38.727 --> 00:00:42.118
of each disposition, and dispositions by channel.

